The '''Intimidation Ring''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Accessory]] and an upgraded form of the {{Item|Intimidation Talisman}}. It prevents monsters at or below level 5 from targeting the player.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Intimidation Ring''' can be purchased from the [[Fear Mongerer]], which is located on the [[Hub Island]] in the [[Event Stand]] during the [[Spooky Festival]].
